  "_notes": [
    "Parts retailer. Often combined with a garage on the same premises —",
    "see combinable_with in business_types.json. This template covers",
    "PARTS only; labor/repair services belong to the garage template.",
    "Vehicle make/model fitment (e.g. 'brake pads — Toyota Probox') is a",
    "real and important variant dimension for this business type that this",
    "taxonomy level doesn't attempt to capture — items are generic part",
    "types here; make/model-specific fitment would be a per-business",
    "product detail, not a taxonomy branch (100s of make/model",
